<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Cementation still in asset sales talks.</title>
<headline>Cementation still in asset sales talks.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa's Cementation Co Africa Ltd said on Wednesday that talks were still in progress on the sale of some of its non-core assets which could impact on its share price if successfully concluded.</p>
<p>Shareholders were urged to exercise caution in a brief announcement.</p>
<p>No further details were given in a brief statement.</p>
